WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.030 --> 00:00:05.390
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and during my
Birds of Prey review I asked you to submit

00:00:05.390 --> 00:00:09.520
all of your questions about the rest of the
season.

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:13.150
Everyone is wondering about Ravager, which
character is going to die and who’s going

00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:16.289
to be the next big villain after Slade.

00:00:16.289 --> 00:00:19.920
So because there’s so much awesome to talk
about, let’s just get right in it.

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:23.680
Like usual I picked 10 of your questions with
one bonus one.

00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:26.780
Careful for spoilers from the episode if you’re
not caught up.

00:00:26.780 --> 00:00:33.400
Here we go Question 1 - Mr Alucard Rules asks
what do you think the episode city of blood

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:34.780
will be about?

00:00:34.780 --> 00:00:38.629
It sounds like they’re teasing that Brother
Blood is going to spread the serum around

00:00:38.629 --> 00:00:41.559
the city and turn a bunch of citizens into
‘brothers’.

00:00:41.559 --> 00:00:46.230
Since it’s so much farther ahead, it’s
also possible that he could win the Mayoral

00:00:46.230 --> 00:00:47.230
election.

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.929
Brother Blood hasn’t been featured much
since Slade’s story came to the forefront.

00:00:49.929 --> 00:00:52.030
And I don’t really mind.

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:56.199
I just haven’t felt like he’s been a threat
to Team Arrow so far.

00:00:56.199 --> 00:00:58.230
He’s like Slade’s squire.

00:00:58.230 --> 00:01:03.010
The underling that runs to get him coffee
and moisturizer for his empty eye socket.

00:01:03.010 --> 00:01:06.750
So City of Blood will just be his chance to
come roaring back into the story.

00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:07.750
Episode 18, Deathstroke, is Slade heavy.

00:01:07.750 --> 00:01:08.750
So City of Blood will just be Brother Blood’s
version of that.

00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:11.850
We might even get some comic book style flashbacks.

00:01:11.850 --> 00:01:15.600
Question 2 - Ijaz Sultan asks Hey Charlie
you know the scene where Roy gets shots in

00:01:15.600 --> 00:01:18.170
the right hand do you think that thats a sort
of Arsenal nod/tease?﻿

00:01:18.170 --> 00:01:23.230
That’s an interesting idea, I hadn’t thought
of it that way but it’s totally possible.

00:01:23.230 --> 00:01:27.979
For those that don’t know, there was a comic
book story where Roy got his arm chopped off.

00:01:27.979 --> 00:01:32.650
That version of the character wasn’t enhanced
by mirakuru, not that mirakuru could help

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:34.259
you grow one back.

00:01:34.259 --> 00:01:35.259
But it’s possible that it was a teaser that
in a future episode, Roy will sustain an injury

00:01:35.259 --> 00:01:36.259
that he can’t heal from, either physical
or emotional.

00:01:36.259 --> 00:01:40.450
They spent a couple moments of dialogue on
Roy telling Oliver that the wound was nothing,

00:01:40.450 --> 00:01:46.350
it just seemed like they were setting him
up to eventually get a super serious injury.

00:01:46.350 --> 00:01:49.070
Like arm chopped off serious.

00:01:49.070 --> 00:01:54.600
Question 3 - Sree Ram asks Did we just see
summer glau's character fight oliver?

00:01:54.600 --> 00:01:57.189
does that mean she works with slade?

00:01:57.189 --> 00:02:01.990
this may seem farfetch'd but could she be
slade's daughter?﻿

00:02:01.990 --> 00:02:07.960
My initial thought was yes, but I had to take
a screengrab to double check.

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:11.430
In all of the frames, her arm was covering
up her face a little.

00:02:11.430 --> 00:02:17.050
But she seems like she has Summer Glau’s
build, tall, thin and punchy.

00:02:17.050 --> 00:02:21.930
If you didn’t know, before she starred in
Firefly for Joss Whedon, she was a professional

00:02:21.930 --> 00:02:23.880
dancer, mostly Ballet.

00:02:23.880 --> 00:02:25.709
So she was super flexible.

00:02:25.709 --> 00:02:29.720
Which is why it was easy for her to do all
those beautiful dancy fight moves.

00:02:29.720 --> 00:02:35.010
The conceit is that Isobel has been working
with Slade this whole time to take control

00:02:35.010 --> 00:02:36.010
of Queen Industries.

00:02:36.010 --> 00:02:38.670
In one of my videos last year I predicted
that Isobel would be connected to HIVE and

00:02:38.670 --> 00:02:40.209
they would be the evil financial arm of Slade’s
plan.

00:02:40.209 --> 00:02:43.310
In the comics, Deathstroke has heavy ties
to HIVE, but we don’t know what his connection

00:02:43.310 --> 00:02:44.580
to them on Arrow is yet.

00:02:44.580 --> 00:02:46.200
Hopefully episode 18 will give us that information.

00:02:46.200 --> 00:02:49.220
How else could the pay for Brother Blood’s
run for Mayor, electoral campaigns are super

00:02:49.220 --> 00:02:50.220
expensive.

00:02:50.220 --> 00:02:51.610
To give you an idea, during the last presidential
campaign, both Obama and Mitt Romney spent

00:02:51.610 --> 00:02:52.690
an estimated 7 Billion Dollars combined.

00:02:52.690 --> 00:02:53.780
Most of that on their television ads and marketing.

00:02:53.780 --> 00:02:56.540
That’s why I think Slade is connected to
HIVE and he’s using them to fund Brother

00:02:56.540 --> 00:02:57.540
Blood.

00:02:57.540 --> 00:02:58.540
And Isobel will turn out to be working for
them.

00:02:58.540 --> 00:03:00.862
HIVE is a really big deal, so I’ll talk
more about them in a sec.

00:03:00.862 --> 00:03:04.450
The real story, is that if Isobel is working
with Slade, is she Ravager.

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:05.659
I think it’s more likely that they’ll
change that character a little so she will

00:03:05.659 --> 00:03:08.280
be Ravager, but her backstory will change
a little.

00:03:08.280 --> 00:03:09.370
I’m hoping that they’ll make her Slade’s
daughter.

00:03:09.370 --> 00:03:10.370
Since some of her backstory already lines
up with Ravagers.

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:11.370
Why else would the cast Summer Glau, someone
who doesn’t necessarily look like a threat,

00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:12.370
but has played martial artists and she was
even a freaking terminator.

00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:13.370
Of course Deathstroke The Terminator’s daughter
would be a Terminator.

00:03:13.370 --> 00:03:15.599
That would make a great title for a season
3 episode “The Terminator’s Daughter”.

00:03:15.599 --> 00:03:19.170
Question 4 - Michael Paulsen (no avatar) asks
Do you think thea will figure out Roys or

00:03:19.170 --> 00:03:21.660
Olivers secret identities during her rescue
mission?

00:03:21.660 --> 00:03:22.660
Yes, definitely.

00:03:22.660 --> 00:03:25.701
I think she’ll find out that they’re involved
in this war with Slade and then they’ll

00:03:25.701 --> 00:03:26.701
tell her the full story.

00:03:26.701 --> 00:03:27.701
Here’s an interesting thought.

00:03:27.701 --> 00:03:28.701
Have you ever heard that a little bit of information
can be really dangerous?

00:03:28.701 --> 00:03:29.701
As opposed to having all of the information.

00:03:29.701 --> 00:03:33.360
I think that Thea is going to pull a similar
move to Laurel last week and let the darkness

00:03:33.360 --> 00:03:36.829
in after getting a little bit of information
about Oliver and Roy.

00:03:36.829 --> 00:03:42.549
If she’s not the one to die this season
then I do expect her to become the next unofficial

00:03:42.549 --> 00:03:43.890
member of team arrow.

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:48.150
A lot of people are wondering if she’s ever
going to become the Mia Dearden.

00:03:48.150 --> 00:03:50.810
Just because Moira’s maiden name was Dearden.

00:03:50.810 --> 00:03:55.299
Not to be super morbid, but I hope Moira becomes
a casualty of the war and it inspires Thea

00:03:55.299 --> 00:03:58.700
to join the new family business.

00:03:58.700 --> 00:04:04.140
Question 5 - Nick Wong asks Based on this
episode, it doesn't look like it was the huntress

00:04:04.140 --> 00:04:06.000
that knocked diggle out in the promise.

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:08.700
Who do you think it is now?﻿

00:04:08.700 --> 00:04:12.349
Since Huntress didn’t end up being as big
a character as I’d hoped, I think the next

00:04:12.349 --> 00:04:13.500
best guess is Isobel or Ravager.

00:04:13.500 --> 00:04:14.500
Which based on that teaser for episode 18
seems more realistic.

00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:15.500
We haven’t seen Summer Glau in so long and
see her throw down with Oliver makes me feel

00:04:15.500 --> 00:04:17.350
like the ‘allies’ Slade said he had included
Isobel.

00:04:17.350 --> 00:04:25.449
I saw a lot of you guys suggesting it might
be Nyssa, but I feel like if it were her,

00:04:25.449 --> 00:04:27.290
they would have shown her face in the episode.

00:04:27.290 --> 00:04:32.120
It’s totally possible that the actress wasn’t
available the day they filmed that Diggle

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:33.590
scene, but for now.

00:04:33.590 --> 00:04:36.100
Based on what we’ve seen, my best guess
is Isobel.

00:04:36.100 --> 00:04:41.419
Question 6 - DarkfireKurai asks With Officer
Lance teaming up with The Arrow, do you think

00:04:41.419 --> 00:04:45.320
its only a matter of time until he gets in-trouble
for doing so?﻿

00:04:45.320 --> 00:04:49.470
Definitely, he totally hit that other officer
in the head to protect Oliver.

00:04:49.470 --> 00:04:54.680
The big teaser for Man Under The Hood, episode
19 is people learning Oliver’s identity.

00:04:54.680 --> 00:04:58.170
And remember, Brother Blood did have people
inside the police department.

00:04:58.170 --> 00:05:03.139
The minion masquerading as Brother Blood was
killed, but that doesn’t mean that Quentin

00:05:03.139 --> 00:05:05.270
has the full support of the department.

00:05:05.270 --> 00:05:10.640
The way I see his character now is a lot like
Jim Gordon during Batman year one.

00:05:10.640 --> 00:05:14.710
He was a rookie cop and had to clear out corruption
in the department, before eventually becoming

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:16.130
Commissioner Gordon.

00:05:16.130 --> 00:05:18.690
I think Quentin is on the same path.

00:05:18.690 --> 00:05:19.690
Hopefully they won’t kill him off this season.

00:05:19.690 --> 00:05:21.580
Just to be clear, I don’t think he’ll
die.

00:05:21.580 --> 00:05:24.470
They’ve invested way too much time in that
character.

00:05:24.470 --> 00:05:29.080
The Batman Gordon parallels are just too awesome
to drop those storylines.

00:05:29.080 --> 00:05:33.670
And Paul Blackthorne is a great actor, you
don’t just get rid of your “A” team.

00:05:33.670 --> 00:05:36.949
Which is why they totally didn’t officially
kill John Barrowman.

00:05:36.949 --> 00:05:38.699
He’s just way too awesome.

00:05:38.699 --> 00:05:41.610
Plus there’s the whole Captain Jack immortality
thing going on.

00:05:41.610 --> 00:05:50.670
Question 7 - The PTMD3 asks Do you think there's
gonna be a Bane-Batman repair (Batman takes

00:05:50.670 --> 00:05:55.370
a bullet for Bane so Bane saves him with Lazarus
Pit) between Slade and Oliver?

00:05:55.370 --> 00:06:01.099
They’ve been posting images of upcoming
episodes where Oliver just gets madder and

00:06:01.099 --> 00:06:05.319
madder, so they want us to think he’s going
to try and kill Slade.

00:06:05.319 --> 00:06:07.599
Especially now with him capturing Thea.

00:06:07.599 --> 00:06:09.770
But I don’t think it’s going to go down
like that.

00:06:09.770 --> 00:06:12.990
What does he say during the intro for every
single episode.

00:06:12.990 --> 00:06:16.530
“I can’t be the killer I once was.”

00:06:16.530 --> 00:06:18.300
Implying that he’ll show Slade mercy.

00:06:18.300 --> 00:06:19.300
I don’t think it will be a near death thing.

00:06:19.300 --> 00:06:20.300
They’re not going to dose Oliver with Mirakuru
and I don’t think we’ll get a Lazarus

00:06:20.300 --> 00:06:21.300
Pit this season.

00:06:21.300 --> 00:06:23.930
But I do think Slade will show him mercy or
help him out.

00:06:23.930 --> 00:06:27.860
It all depends on if the Ra’s Al Ghul cameo
works out.

00:06:27.860 --> 00:06:30.470
Marc Guggenheim and Manu Bennett teased it.

00:06:30.470 --> 00:06:42.770
They said it depends on a lot of things behind
the scenes working out, so it’s still unconfirmed.

00:06:42.770 --> 00:06:48.250
Question 8 - Loriandanna asks Do you think
that Slade is just in a Mirakuru Rage or is

00:06:48.250 --> 00:06:51.180
there a little bit more of him that has turned
evil?

00:06:51.180 --> 00:06:53.670
That’s what we’re going to learn about
in Episode 18.

00:06:53.670 --> 00:06:58.650
We’ll learn what the Mirakuru has done to
his brain for the last 6 years.

00:06:58.650 --> 00:06:59.850
Mostly made him crazy.

00:06:59.850 --> 00:07:04.370
It is a lot like the psychosis people experience
after using the Lazarus Pit.

00:07:04.370 --> 00:07:06.740
They just go insane temporarily.

00:07:06.740 --> 00:07:11.759
I think that madness will be Slade’s cross
to bear for the rest of his long-mirakuru-enhanced

00:07:11.759 --> 00:07:12.759
life.

00:07:12.759 --> 00:07:16.590
And it will just be like a wound that never
heals.

00:07:16.590 --> 00:07:21.830
Like Wolverine’s claws hurting every time
he pops them out.

00:07:21.830 --> 00:07:25.960
Question 9 - Radbot Films asks Did you notice
all the Red in the Episode?

00:07:25.960 --> 00:07:31.099
Yes, everyone took it to mean Red Arrow and
Red Hood teasers.

00:07:31.099 --> 00:07:34.259
I think it’s mostly foreshadowing Roy’s
Arsenal persona.

00:07:34.259 --> 00:07:37.090
And Brother Blood’s plan to convert the
city.

00:07:37.090 --> 00:07:38.090
Blood Red.

00:07:38.090 --> 00:07:41.680
There was also the Nightwing symbol in an
earlier episode.

00:07:41.680 --> 00:07:45.800
It’s just easy ways for them to include
references to characters without creating

00:07:45.800 --> 00:07:51.130
the burden of casting actors or finding ways
to fit more intellectual property into a story

00:07:51.130 --> 00:07:53.650
than is necessary.

00:07:53.650 --> 00:07:56.379
Most of the time it’s more of a wink.

00:07:56.379 --> 00:07:59.650
Like Gail Street and Simone Avenue during
Birds of Prey.

00:07:59.650 --> 00:08:01.300
Just a really quick shot here and there.

00:08:01.300 --> 00:08:06.790
I try not to read too much into it, but it
does make it fun to re-watch episodes to look

00:08:06.790 --> 00:08:08.460
for easter eggs.

00:08:08.460 --> 00:08:14.479
Question 10 - Crystal X asks Who would be
the most unexpected character to die?﻿

00:08:14.479 --> 00:08:17.090
Most unexpected death would of course be Oliver.

00:08:17.090 --> 00:08:22.680
The only way that would work would be if they
featured the Lazarus Pit, or Arrow’s version

00:08:22.680 --> 00:08:23.919
of the Lazarus Pit.

00:08:23.919 --> 00:08:26.090
Which I don’t think is the mirakuru.

00:08:26.090 --> 00:08:29.960
It can’t bring someone dead back to life.

00:08:29.960 --> 00:08:32.870
And most of the time, it straight up kills
people.

00:08:32.870 --> 00:08:37.470
Of the people that might actually die, the
most unexpected I think would be Thea.

00:08:37.470 --> 00:08:39.500
Usually you cull the weak ones out of the
herd.

00:08:39.500 --> 00:08:43.510
And Moira feels like she’s just been blowing
smoke.

00:08:43.510 --> 00:08:47.330
Thea on the other hand could totally become
a superhero in her own right given the right

00:08:47.330 --> 00:08:48.550
story arc.

00:08:48.550 --> 00:08:50.560
Which might be what’s happening right now.

00:08:50.560 --> 00:08:55.990
So if she did die, it would be a huge surprise.

00:08:55.990 --> 00:09:01.630
Bonus Question 1 - Pepper Jim asks How do
you think that the Deathstroke story arc will

00:09:01.630 --> 00:09:03.720
end?

00:09:03.720 --> 00:09:11.580
With Oliver defeating Slade and bringing him
back to sanity.

00:09:11.580 --> 00:09:14.170
Then them parting ways, not as friends.

00:09:14.170 --> 00:09:16.850
But as brothers that just hate each other.

00:09:16.850 --> 00:09:20.110
They really pushed the idea of them as ‘brothers’
during The Promise.

00:09:20.110 --> 00:09:22.930
I think that theme is going to come back around
before the finale.

00:09:22.930 --> 00:09:27.120
I don’t think Slade will die, they didn’t
kill Merlin.

00:09:27.120 --> 00:09:32.440
And who else here wants a Deathstroke spinoff,
or a Teen Titans spinoff that Slade is a huge

00:09:32.440 --> 00:09:33.440
part of.

00:09:33.440 --> 00:09:40.890
They wouldn’t be able to do any of that
if he were dead.

00:09:40.890 --> 00:09:46.840
Bonus Question 2 - PG Eire asks If Oliver
defeats Slade, who will be the season 3 villain?

00:09:46.840 --> 00:09:50.350
So based on my last answer, yes of course
Oliver will defeat Slade.

00:09:50.350 --> 00:09:55.510
And I don’t think anyone expects him to
be the biggest villain again next season.

00:09:55.510 --> 00:09:57.900
So how do you top Deathstroke?

00:09:57.900 --> 00:09:59.590
There’s a couple of possibilities.

00:09:59.590 --> 00:10:02.200
One, it could be the organization HIVE.

00:10:02.200 --> 00:10:04.240
Who’s in charge of that at the moment?

00:10:04.240 --> 00:10:05.310
No Idea.

00:10:05.310 --> 00:10:08.550
But the organization itself would be the villain.

00:10:08.550 --> 00:10:13.230
The other possibility is a Justice League
villain like Prometheus or Amazo, they’ve

00:10:13.230 --> 00:10:16.580
been showing that Amazo boat so freaking much
this season.

00:10:16.580 --> 00:10:21.020
I’m not expecting any cosmic villains or
outright super powered villains.

00:10:21.020 --> 00:10:24.580
At least supervillains who don’t use technology
to enhance their abilities.

00:10:24.580 --> 00:10:29.340
The Flash show is going to be the first to
tackle real super powers.

00:10:29.340 --> 00:10:36.130
Really I think Prometheus would be a good
fit, plus there’s the whole Cry for Justice

00:10:36.130 --> 00:10:38.490
storyline where he chops off Roy’s arm.

00:10:38.490 --> 00:10:42.650
Not that I think arrow would ever make Colton
Haynes limp around with one arm for the rest

00:10:42.650 --> 00:10:43.650
of the series.

00:10:43.650 --> 00:10:45.150
That would just be cruel.

00:10:45.150 --> 00:10:46.690
So thank you so much for submitting your questions.

00:10:46.690 --> 00:10:49.290
This was a ton of fun, like I said.

00:10:49.290 --> 00:10:51.070
Next week is a deep dive into Deathstroke.

00:10:51.070 --> 00:10:53.430
Be sure to subscribe to get my video.

00:10:53.430 --> 00:10:56.700
Just think about how awesome it’s going
to be.

00:10:56.700 --> 00:10:59.480
In the meantime, check out my review of the
episode here and click here to learn more

00:10:59.480 --> 00:11:00.680
about the Avengers 2 Villains.

00:11:00.680 --> 00:11:01.680
Thanks for watching, see you guys tomorrow.

00:11:01.680 --> 00:11:01.940
High Fives!

